### Notice and Announcement API Documentation

# ===========================================
# NOTICE API ENDPOINTS
# ===========================================

### 1. Create Notice (Admin/Teacher Only)
POST https://localhost:5001/api/notice/create
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Form Data:
# Title: Semester Exam Schedule
# Content: Semester exams will begin from November 1st, 2025. Please check the detailed schedule attached.
# Category: Academic
# Priority: High
# TargetAudience: Student
# IsActive: true
# IsPinned: true
# ExpiryDate: 2025-12-31
# Attachment: @/path/to/exam_schedule.pdf

###

### 2. Get All Notices (with Pagination and Filters)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/all?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/all?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=exam&category=Academic&priority=High&targetAudience=Student&isActive=true
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/all?pageNumber=2&pageSize=20&startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2025-12-31
###

### 3. Get Active Notices (Public Access)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/active
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/active?targetAudience=Student
###

### 4. Get Notice By ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/1
###

### 5. Update Notice (Admin/Teacher Only)
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/notice/update/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Form Data:
# Title: Updated Exam Schedule
# Content: Exam dates have been revised. New schedule attached.
# Category: Academic
# Priority: Urgent
# TargetAudience: Student
# IsActive: true
# IsPinned: true
# ExpiryDate: 2025-12-31
# Attachment: @/path/to/updated_schedule.pdf

###

### 6. Delete Notice (Admin/Teacher Only) - Soft Delete
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/notice/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
###

### 7. Get Notices By Audience
GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/by-audience/Student
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/by-audience/Teacher
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/notice/by-audience/All
###

# ===========================================
# ANNOUNCEMENT API ENDPOINTS
# ===========================================

### 1. Create Announcement (Admin/Teacher Only)
POST https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/create
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Form Data:
# Title: Annual Tech Fest 2025
# Content: Join us for the Annual Tech Fest from Dec 15-17. Register now!
# Category: Event
# Priority: Normal
# TargetAudience: All
# IsActive: true
# IsPinned: false
# ExpiryDate: 2025-12-18
# Attachment: @/path/to/techfest_poster.jpg

###

### 2. Get All Announcements (with Pagination and Filters)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/all?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/all?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&search=fest&category=Event&priority=Normal
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/all?pageNumber=1&pageSize=15&isPinned=true&isActive=true
###

### 3. Get Active Announcements (Public Access)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/active
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/active?targetAudience=All
###

### 4. Get Announcement By ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/1
###

### 5. Update Announcement (Admin/Teacher Only)
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/update/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Form Data:
# Title: Updated Tech Fest Schedule
# Content: Tech Fest dates extended! Now from Dec 15-20.
# Category: Event
# Priority: High
# TargetAudience: All
# IsActive: true
# IsPinned: true
# ExpiryDate: 2025-12-21

###

### 6. Delete Announcement (Admin/Teacher Only) - Soft Delete
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
###

### 7. Get Announcements By Audience
GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/by-audience/Student
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/by-audience/Teacher
###

GET https://localhost:5001/api/announcement/by-audience/All
###

