# ===========================================
# FILTER PARAMETERS
# ===========================================

# Available filters for both Notice and Announcement:
# - search: Search in title and content (string)
# - category: Filter by category (string)
# - priority: Low | Normal | High | Urgent
# - targetAudience: All | Student | Teacher
# - isActive: true | false
# - isPinned: true | false
# - startDate: Filter from date (YYYY-MM-DD)
# - endDate: Filter to date (YYYY-MM-DD)
# - pageNumber: Page number (default: 1)
# - pageSize: Items per page (default: 10)

# ===========================================
# AUTHORIZATION
# ===========================================

# Public Access (No Auth Required):
# - GET /api/notice/active
# - GET /api/notice/by-audience/{audience}
# - GET /api/announcement/active
# - GET /api/announcement/by-audience/{audience}

# Authenticated Users (JWT Required):
# - GET /api/notice/all
# - GET /api/notice/{id}
# - GET /api/announcement/all
# - GET /api/announcement/{id}

# Admin/Teacher Only (JWT + Role Required):
# - POST /api/notice/create
# - PUT /api/notice/update/{id}
# - DELETE /api/notice/delete/{id}
# - POST /api/announcement/create
# - PUT /api/announcement/update/{id}
# - DELETE /api/announcement/delete/{id}

# ===========================================
# FILE UPLOAD
# ===========================================

# Allowed file types: .pdf, .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .doc, .docx
# Maximum file size: 10MB
# Files are stored in:
# - Notices: wwwroot/uploads/notices/
# - Announcements: wwwroot/uploads/announcements/

# ===========================================
# FEATURES IMPLEMENTED
# ===========================================

# ✅ Full CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)
# ✅ Pagination with metadata (pageNumber, pageSize, totalCount, totalPages)
# ✅ Advanced filtering (search, category, priority, date range, status)
# ✅ File upload support with validation
# ✅ Role-based authorization (SUPER_ADMIN, TEACHER, Student)
# ✅ Soft delete (IsDeleted flag)
# ✅ View count tracking
# ✅ Pinned notices/announcements (show at top)
# ✅ Expiry date handling
# ✅ Target audience filtering (All, Student, Teacher)
# ✅ Active/Inactive status
# ✅ Creator information in responses
